_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: For reservation JMO1MG:\n\n- Membership: silver\n- Cabin: economy\n- Passengers: 2\n- Free checked bag allowance for silver economy passengers: 2 free checked bags per passenger\n- Total free checked bag allowance: 4 checked bags\n- Currently booked total checked bags: 1\n- Currently booked paid checked bags: 0\n\nSo you are allowed to take 1 checked suitcase under your current booking without extra payment. You could have up to 4 checked suitcases total for free on this reservation based on your allowance.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T20:13:00"}
