{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "I'm calling about the delay to flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm a valued Gold member, and I'm extremely upset because this delay will make me miss an important meeting.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear that. I can help check the flight status and review available options.\n\nPlease provide:\n- your user id\n- your reservation id\n- the flight date for HAT045\n\nAlso, please let me know whether you want to change or cancel the reservation.\nassistant: Please provide the flight date for HAT045 and your reservation id so I can confirm the details.  \n\nUnder the policy, compensation for delayed flights is only available when the delay is confirmed and the reservation is changed or cancelled. Since you do not want to change or cancel, I can check the flight status, but I cannot offer compensation for this delay.\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I can\u2019t provide compensation or goodwill credit for this delay while the reservation remains unchanged. Under the policy, delayed-flight compensation is only available after the reservation is changed or cancelled, and you said you do not want either.\\n\\nIf you want me to review the reservation details or flight status, I still need the reservation ID and flight date.\"}", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T20:13:00"}
