{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I\u2019d like to change an upcoming return flight on my existing reservation. I\u2019m currently flying from ATL to LAX with one stop, but I want to change it to a nonstop flight from ATL to Las Vegas instead.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with flight changes, but existing reservations can\u2019t be modified to change the destination or trip type. A return flight from ATL to LAX can\u2019t be changed to ATL to Las Vegas within the same reservation.\n\nIf you want, I can help with either:\n1. Changing the flight to another ATL-to-LAX option, if eligible, or\n2. Reviewing cancellation eligibility for the existing reservation and booking a separate ATL-to-Las Vegas flight.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T20:13:00"}
