{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I\u2019m Raj Brown. I need to change my upcoming roundtrip because of a health issue, and I did buy insurance for the trip, so I\u2019m hoping the change fees can be waived.\n\nMy current trip is DTW to LGA and back, and I want to switch it to nonstop DTW to JFK and back on the same dates.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I can help with the flight change, but I need two things first: your user id and your reservation id. I also need your explicit confirmation after I list the change details.\\n\\nProposed change: update your round-trip reservation from DTW-LGA and back to nonstop DTW-JFK and back on the same dates. Because you said you have insurance, I will verify the reservation details and then check whether the change can be processed.\",\"needed\":[\"user id\",\"reservation id\",\"confirmation yes after details are listed\"]}\nassistant: I\u2019m pulling the reservation first so I can use the actual trip dates and current cabin before I look at flight options or baggage changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit