{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need help with a few upcoming reservations. I\u2019d like to cancel two bookings and upgrade another one to business class.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Please send these details for each booking:\\n1. Your user id\\n2. The two reservation ids you want canceled, plus the reason for each cancellation: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons\\n3. The reservation id you want upgraded to business class\\n4. Confirmation that you want me to proceed after I list the action details and checks\"}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Action details and checks:\\n1. Cancel reservation `IFOYYZ` for user `aarav_ahmed_6699`.\\n   - Reason provided: change of plan.\\n   - Check: cancellation is only allowed if the booking meets one of the policy conditions.\\n2. Cancel reservation `NQNU5R` for user `aarav_ahmed_6699`.\\n   - Reason provided: change of plan.\\n   - Check: cancellation is only allowed if the booking meets one of the policy conditions.\\n3. Upgrade reservation `M20IZO` to business class.\\n   - Check: cabin changes are only allowed if no part of the reservation has already been flown.\\n   - Check: if the new cabin price is higher, you will need to pay the difference; if lower, you will be refunded the difference.\\n\\nReply with `yes` to confirm that I should proceed with these actions.\"}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"IFOYYZ\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT157\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT215\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 65}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 116}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T00:14:30\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NQNU5R\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cab", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T20:13:00"}
