{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I\u2019m Raj Brown. I have an upcoming roundtrip from DTW to LGA, but because of a health issue I need to change my flights. I purchased insurance for the trip, so I\u2019m hoping any change fees can be waived.\n\nI\u2019d like to switch the trip to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back, on the same dates as my current reservation.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I can help review your reservation, but flight modifications cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type. Changing from LGA to JFK would not be allowed as a modification to the existing reservation. If eligible, you may need to cancel the current reservation and book a new DTW-JFK round trip.\\n\\nPlease provide your user id and reservation id so I can look up the reservation and check the available options.\"}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I found reservation VA5SGQ for user raj_brown_5782: round trip DTW to LGA, economy, with travel insurance, for Raj Brown.\\n\\nYour requested change to DTW to JFK and back cannot be made as a modification because flight changes must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. I can help with either of these options:\\n\\n1. Modify the existing DTW-LGA reservation to different DTW-LGA flights on the same dates, if available.\\n2. Check whether you can cancel this reservation, then help book a new DTW-JFK round trip.\\n\\nHow would you like to proceed?\"}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T21:48:56"}
