{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need help changing my upcoming roundtrip flight. I\u2019ve been dealing with a health issue, and since I bought insurance for the trip, I\u2019m hoping the change fees can be waived.\n\nMy current reservation is for DTW to LGA and back, but I need to switch it to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back on the same dates. I only want early flights that arrive before 7am, and I\u2019d like the cheapest Economy options, not Basic Economy.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I can help check your reservation, but flight modifications cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type. Changing DTW-LGA to DTW-JFK would require cancelling the existing reservation if eligible, then booking a new DTW-JFK round trip.\\n\\nPlease provide your user id and reservation id so I can review the reservation details and cancellation eligibility. If you do not know the reservation id, provide your user id and I can look it up.\"}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Your reservation VA5SGQ is a round trip from DTW to LGA in economy with travel insurance. Under the flight-change policy, I cannot modify it to DTW to JFK because changing flights cannot change the destination.\\n\\nSince you have travel insurance and cited a health issue, I can help cancel this reservation if you want. After cancellation, I can search for new nonstop DTW-JFK round-trip flights on the same dates. Please confirm whether you want to proceed with cancellation review and new booking search.\"}\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT169\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"status\": \"available\", \"sche", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T21:48:56"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Hi. I\u2019m Omar Davis, and I need help downgrading all my business-class flights to economy. I\u2019m dealing with some financial issues right now, so I need to save money where I can. I don\u2019t want to change the flights or the passengers\u2014just the cabin class.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with changing the cabin class. Please provide your user id and reservation id.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found these reservations under your account: JG7FMM, LQ940Q, 2FBBAH, X7BYG1, EQ1G6C, BOH180.\n\nI need to check each reservation before making any cabin changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_t