ay be allowed with refund to the original payment method. If you want, I can help you cancel this DTW\u2013LGA reservation, and then help book a new DTW\u2013JFK round trip for the same dates.\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Cancellation details: reservation VA5SGQ (DTW to LGA round trip), 1 passenger, economy cabin, travel insurance purchased, cancellation reason: health issue. If eligible under the insurance, the refund will be sent to the original payment method within 5 to 7 business days. Please confirm by replying \\\"yes\\\" to cancel this reservation.\"}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"ori", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T23:40:46"}
