n\u2019s destination is LGA, so changing it to JFK is not permitted within the modification policy.\n\nI can help you look for nonstop DTW\u2013LGA flights on the same dates, or if you want to cancel the reservation due to the health issue and insurance, I can check cancellation eligibility.\nassistant: Yes. Based on the reservation details:\n\n- Reservation: VA5SGQ\n- User: raj_brown_5782\n- Trip: DTW to LGA round trip\n- Departure dates: starting 2024-05-17\n- Cabin: economy\n- Travel insurance: yes\n- Reason: health issue\n\nBecause the trip has not started yet and the reservation has travel insurance, cancellation for a health reason is eligible under the policy. The refund would go back to the original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\n\nWould you like me to cancel reservation VA5SGQ? Please reply \u201cyes\u201d to confirm.\ntool", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:34:43"}
