ble within the policy. Travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking, and I\u2019m unable to add it to this reservation.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:34:43"}
