K round trip if flights are available.\\n\\nDo you want to proceed with cancellation and then search for new DTW-JFK flights on the same dates?\"}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Before I cancel reservation VA5SGQ, please confirm the cancellation details:\\n\\nAction: Cancel reservation VA5SGQ for user raj_brown_5782\\nCurrent trip: Round trip, DTW to LGA, economy\\nFlights: HAT035 on 2024-05-17, HAT066 on 2024-05-17, HAT002 on 2024-05-19, HAT106 on 2024-05-20\\nPassengers: Raj Brown\\nReason category: other reasons, health", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:34:43"}
