t to this reservation now.\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t make an exception or add insurance manually after the initial booking. The reservation record shows insurance is not included, and policy does not allow adding insurance after booking.\nassistant: I checked the reservation record, and insurance is not included. The available policy does not provide another option to add travel insurance after initial booking.\n\nI can still help with other eligible changes to your reservation, such as adding checked bags or checking flight details, but I cannot add insurance to this booking.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:49:33"}
