{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need help changing an upcoming flight. I\u2019m flying from EWR on May 21, and I\u2019d like to switch to a nonstop flight that same day if possible. My mother is really sick, and I need to get home sooner to take care of her.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry to hear that. I can help check whether your reservation can be changed and look for nonstop options.\n\nPlease provide:\n- Your user ID\n- Your reservation ID\n\nIf you don\u2019t know the reservation ID, provide your user ID and I can help locate it.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found these reservations on your profile: OWZ4XL, F3IQK1, 8WMF4C, and L2H5FP.\n\nI\u2019ll need to check which one is the upcoming May 21 flight from EWR. Please provide the reservation ID if you recognize it, or I can check them one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\",