{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need help changing an upcoming roundtrip because I\u2019ve been dealing with a health issue. I took insurance for the trip, so I\u2019m hoping the change fees can be waived.\n\nI currently have a DTW to LGA roundtrip, and I want to switch it to nonstop DTW to JFK and back on the same dates. I only want early flights that arrive before 7am, and I\u2019d like the cheapest Economy options, not Basic Economy.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help check options and change the flights if eligible. Please provide:\n\n1. Your user ID  \n2. Your reservation ID  \n3. Your outbound date and return date, if you know them\n\nAlso, for flight changes, any payment or refund method must be a single credit card or gift card already in your profile. After I review the reservation and available flights, I\u2019ll list the change details and ask for your explicit confirmation before updating anything.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: {\n  \"message\": \"I reviewed reservation VA5SGQ. It is an Economy round trip from DTW to LGA, with outbound travel on 2024-05-17 and return travel beginning on 2024-05-19. Travel insurance is included.\\n\\nI cannot change this reservation from LGA to JFK because flight modifications must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. Travel insurance can enable a full refund for cancellation for covered health or weather reasons, but it does not allow changing the destination.\\n\\nI can help with one of these options:\\n1. Search for Economy DTW to LGA alternatives on the same dates.\\n2. Help cancel the insured reservation for a", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:49:33"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need help with an existing reservation first \u2014 I\u2019d like to remove one passenger from it. And after that, I\u2019m hoping to book a new round-trip flight to the West Coast.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with the existing reservation and then the new booking.\n\nFor removing a passenger: the policy does not allow changing the number of passengers on a reservation, and even a human agent cannot modify the number of passengers. I can help modify passenger information for the same number of passengers, or help cancel the reservation if it qualifies.\n\nFor the existing reservation, please provide:\n- Your user ID\n- Your reservation ID, if you know it\n\nFor the new round-trip booking, after we address the existing reservation, I\u2019ll need your user ID, trip type, origin, destination, dates, cabin, passenger details, baggage needs, travel insurance choice, and payment method from your profile.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1968-08-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 897}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T04:50:18\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassista