d reasons, but it does not allow changing the destination.\n\nI can help with either of these options:\n1. Search for alternate flights for the same route: DTW to LGA and LGA to DTW on the same dates.\n2. Help cancel the insured reservation due to the health issue, if eligible, and then help book a new DTW to JFK round trip.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"127 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 411\", \"city\": \"San Jose\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"95153\"}, \"email\": \"raj.brown6519@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\", \"payment_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:49:33"}
