{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming roundtrip flights because of a health problem, and I have travel insurance for the trip. The reservation is currently from DTW to LGA and back, but I\u2019d like to see whether it can be changed to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back on the same dates.", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Please provide your user ID and reservation ID so I can look up the reservation and check what changes are allowed.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t change this reservation from DTW\u2013LGA to DTW\u2013JFK. Flight changes cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type. I can help look for alternate flights that keep the same route, DTW to LGA and LGA back to DTW, on the same dates.\"}\nassistant: {\"message\":\"Travel insurance does not allow an exception to change the destination on an existing reservation. Under the flight modification rules, the origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed. The other available options I can handle are: change to other eligible flights on the same DTW\u2013LGA round trip, change cabin, add checked bags, update passenger information, or check whether the reservation is eligible for cancellation.\"}", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T11:47:33"}
