{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I\u2019m calling about an upcoming flight. I thought I had added insurance to my booking, but when I check online it doesn\u2019t show up. I\u2019m traveling with family and they all have insurance on their flights, so I really need to get it added to mine too.Hi, I\u2019m calling about an upcoming flight. I thought I had added insurance to my booking, but when I check online it doesn\u2019t show up. I\u2019m traveling with family and they all have insurance on their flights, so I really need to get it added to mine too.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can check your reservation details, but per policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking.  \n\nPlease provide your user ID and reservation ID so I can verify whether insurance is already included on your booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I checked reservation PEP4E0 for user sophia_taylor_9065. The booking shows:\n\n- Passenger: Sophia Taylor\n- Trip: CLT to PHX on 2024-05-20\n- Cabin: basic economy\n- Travel insurance: no\n\nTravel insurance is not currently included on this reservation. Per policy, insurance cannot be added after the initial booking, so I\u2019m not able to add it now.\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t make an exception or add insurance after the initial booking. The reservation record shows insurance is \u201cno,\u201d and the policy does not allow adding insurance after booking.\nassistant: I checked the reservation record carefully. It shows:\n\n- Insurance: no\n- Payment charged: $128\n- Passenger count: 1\n\nInsurance would have been $30 for one passenger, and there is no insurance charge shown in the reservation payment history. I do not have a tool that shows any separate pending or failed insurance purchase outside the reservation record.\n\nBased on the booking record, insurance was not added at purchase, and I\u2019m not able to add it after the initial booking.\nassistant", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T13:36:17"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change an existing reservation. I have an upcoming one-stop return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I want to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with reservation changes, but flight changes cannot alter the origin, destination, or trip type of the reservation. Switching the destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas is not allowed as a modification.\n\nIf you\u2019d like, I can help check whether your current reservation can be cancelled, and then help book a new Atlanta to Las Vegas flight. To proceed with cancellation review, please provide your user ID and reservation ID.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T13:36:17"}
