{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change an existing reservation. I have an upcoming one-stop return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I want to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I\u2019m not looking to book a new trip, just modify the current booking.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with modifying an existing reservation, but flight changes must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. Changing the destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas is not allowed as a modification.\n\nIf you\u2019d like, I can help you with options that keep the same origin and destination, or help cancel the existing reservation if it meets the cancellation rules.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:29:33"}
