{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I\u2019m calling about my upcoming flight. I thought I had added insurance to my booking, but when I look online it doesn\u2019t seem to show up. I\u2019m traveling with family and they all have insurance already, so I really need to make sure it\u2019s added to my flight too.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can check your reservation details. Please provide your user id and reservation id.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Your reservation PEP4E0 currently shows travel insurance: no.\n\nPer policy, travel insurance cannot be added after initial booking. Therefore, I\u2019m not able to add insurance to this reservation.\nassistant: I checked reservation PEP4E0, and it shows travel insurance: no.\n\nTravel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking, and I do not have a manual option to add it now.\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but there is no exception or other available way for me to add or attach travel insurance after the initial booking. The reservation shows insurance: no, and policy does not allow adding insurance now.\nassistant: I\u2019m not able to add insurance or create an exce