{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to remove a passenger from one of my reservations.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified. Even a human agent cannot remove a passenger from an existing reservation.\nassistant: Yes. To check whether the reservation is eligible for cancellation, please provide:\n\n1. Your user ID  \n2. Your reservation ID  \n3. The reason for cancellation: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1968-08-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 897}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T04:50:18\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but this reservation is not eligible for cancellation under the policy.\n\nReservation H9ZU1C:\n- Cabin: economy\n- Insurance: no\n- Created: 2024-05-01 04:50:18, which is more than 24 hours ago\n- Reason: change of plans\n- Flights are upcoming, but no qualifying cancellation condition applies\n\nEligible cancellation reasons would include booking within the last 24 hours, airline-cancelled flight, business cabin, or covered travel insurance reason.\ntool: [{\"iata\": \"SFO\", \"city\": \"San Francisco\"}, {\"iata\": \"JFK\", \"city\": \"New York\"}, {\"iata\": \"LAX\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\"}, {\"iata\": \"ORD\", \"city\": \"Chicago\"}, {\"iata\": \"DFW\", \"city\": \"Dallas\"}, {\"iata\": \"DEN\", \"city\": \"Denver\"}, {\"iata\": \"SEA\", \"city\": \"Seattle\"}, {\"iata\": \"ATL\", \"city\": \"Atlanta\"}, {\"iata\": \"MIA\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "d660e09e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:29:33"}
