{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "Hi... I need to change the date on my flight in reservation EUJUY6. I\u2019m Lucas Brown, user ID lucas_brown_4047. My wife passed away yesterday, and I need to move the trip out by 2 days. I do not want to cancel it.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry for your loss.\n\nI checked reservation EUJUY6. This reservation is in **basic economy**, and under the airline policy, **basic economy flights cannot be modified**. So I\u2019m not able to change the flight dates for this reservation.\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t make an exception to modify the dates on a **basic economy** reservation. The policy does not allow basic economy flights to be modified, and I don\u2019t have a bereavement exception available within the tools or policy.\n\nSince your reservation has travel insurance, cancellation may be possible if you choose to cancel, but I understand you said you do not want to cancel.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "2e151d41", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:52:30"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "I need to change an upcoming roundtrip booking because of a health issue, and I\u2019m hoping the change fees can be waived since I bought insurance.\n\nMy current reservation is under Raj Brown, user ID `raj_brown_5782`, reservation `VA5SGQ`. It\u2019s a DTW to LGA roundtrip, and I want to switch it to nonstop DTW to JFK and back on the same trip dates, with only early flights that arrive before 7am. I also want the cheapest Economy option, not Basic Economy, and I need to add 1 checked bag.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can do that, but I need your explicit confirmation first.\n\nPlanned changes for reservation `VA5SGQ`:\n1. Change the nonstop round trip from `DTW -> LGA` to `DTW -> JFK` on the same trip dates.\n2. Restrict both legs to the earliest nonstop Economy flights that arrive before 7:00 AM.\n3. Add 1 checked bag.\n\nReply `yes` if you want me to proceed. If the flight change creates a fare difference, I\u2019ll also need a single credit card or gift card already on your profile for payment or refund handling.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t change this reservation from `DTW -> LGA` to `DTW -> JFK`, because flight modifications cannot change the destination city/airport on an existing reservation.\n\nI can still help with either of these:\n1. Change the flights while keeping the original route `DTW -> LGA` round trip, if eligible.\n2. Add 1 checked bag to reservation `VA5SGQ`.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT169\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"04:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"06:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basi", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "2e151d41", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:52:30"}
